# gtA5_cfet_techfile_bsm_streamout.layermap -- Innovus streamOut layermap, GTA5 CFET (MATRIX-A5).
# Frontside routing (M0-M13, RDL, vias) plus the backside BSPDN stack (BPR, TSV, BSM1/2/3, BSV1/2).
# FEOL / MEOL / inter-tier cuts are in the LVS layermap gtA5_cfet_techfile.layermap, not here.
VG  NET,SPNET,FILL,FILLOPC,VIA,VIAFILL,VIAFILLOPC,LEFOBS   12 0
VG  PIN,LEFPIN                                             12 251
NAME  VG/NET    12 20
NAME  VG/SPNET  12 20
NAME  VG/PIN    12 20
NAME  VG/LEFPIN 12 20

